 - Billing periods are half-open `[period_start, period_end)`; the renewal is billed on
   `period_end`. Month arithmetic clamps to the end of shorter months.
 - Retired plans (`active=False`) cannot be sold; existing customers keep renewing on them.
+- Plan changes (`change_plan`) credit the unused days of the current period at the current
+  price. If the new terms cost more than that credit, they start now and the difference is
+  invoiced. Otherwise nothing is refunded: the change is scheduled for the end of the paid
+  period and applied by the renewal. Same interval keeps the period dates; a new interval
+  starts a full period today.
